KetLuanKhaNangThamGia "1" -- "0..*" HoSoVuotTaiNgoaiLe
NhuCauNguonLuc "1" -- "0..*" PhuongAnBoTri
PhuongAnBoTri "1" *-- "1..*" ChiTietBoTri
