PhuongAnBoTri "1" -- "0..*" DiemXungDot
DiemXungDot "0..*" -- "1" NguonLuc
DiemXungDot "1" *-- "1..*" NhatKyXuLyXungDot
DiemXungDot "1" -- "0..1" PhanXuXungDot
PhuongAnBoTri "1" -- "0..*" DeXuatThayDoi
PhuongAnBoTri "1" -- "0..*" HoSoTrinhDuyet
ChiTietBoTri "0..*" -- "1" DonGia
PhuongAnBoTri "1" -- "0..1" DuToanChiPhi
PhuongAnBoTri "1" -- "0..*" ChiPhiThucTe
PhuongAnBoTri "1" -- "0..*" DanhGiaChiPhi
ChiTietSoSanh "0..*" -- "1" PhuongAnBoTri
